[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0010","text":"（…………欸？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0020","text":"嗯～\n好顽固的污渍啊～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0030","text":"（在打扫……\n　一个人做，会不会很辛苦……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0040","text":"咦，小糸……？\n辛苦了～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0050","text":"啊……\n那、那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0060","text":"……在……在打扫…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0070","text":"啊～\n发现了污渍，就想擦一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0080","text":"本来打算很快就搞定的～\n结果一开始弄，就到处都在意起来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0100","text":"既然都开始了，就把它擦得亮晶晶的吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0110","text":"……那，个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0120","text":"……？\n小糸，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0130","text":"…………没、没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0140","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0150","text":"（我去拿抹布……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03022200_01_0151","text":"Motion"}]
